Third-party material
--------------------
This package contains no third-party source code, fonts, or artwork. The
icon (icon.svg) was drawn for this project.

The package declares a single peer dependency on @deepseek-ai/cordis, which is
supplied by the DeepSeek Harness installation. It has no runtime dependencies
and imports no @deepseek-ai/* module at runtime; every Harness capability is
reached through the Cordis context object.
